Function:
  - (cost)
  + (total-cost) :total-cost
Action:
  - create: ?p - place
      pre: (and (source ?p))
      eff: (and (increase (cost) 1) (increase (value ?p) 1))
  + create: ?p - place
      pre: (and (source ?p))
      eff: (and (increase (total-cost) 1) (increase (value ?p) 1))
  - fire-one-to-one: ?p1 - place ?p2 - place
      pre: (and (> (value ?p1) 0) (one-to-one ?p1 ?p2))
      eff: (and (decrease (value ?p1) 1) (increase (cost) 1) (increase (value ?p2) 1))
  + fire-one-to-one: ?p1 - place ?p2 - place
      pre: (and (> (value ?p1) 0) (one-to-one ?p1 ?p2))
      eff: (and (decrease (value ?p1) 1) (increase (total-cost) 1) (increase (value ?p2) 1))
  - fire-one-to-two: ?p1 - place ?p2 - place ?p3 - place
      pre: (and (> (value ?p1) 0) (one-to-two ?p1 ?p2 ?p3))
      eff: (and (decrease (value ?p1) 1) (increase (cost) 1) (increase (value ?p2) 1) (increase (value ?p3) 1))
  + fire-one-to-two: ?p1 - place ?p2 - place ?p3 - place
      pre: (and (> (value ?p1) 0) (one-to-two ?p1 ?p2 ?p3))
      eff: (and (decrease (value ?p1) 1) (increase (total-cost) 1) (increase (value ?p2) 1) (increase (value ?p3) 1))
  - fire-three-to-one: ?p1 - place ?p2 - place ?p3 - place ?p4 - place
      pre: (and (> (value ?p1) 0) (> (value ?p2) 0) (> (value ?p3) 0) (three-to-one ?p1 ?p2 ?p3 ?p4))
      eff: (and (decrease (value ?p1) 1) (decrease (value ?p2) 1) (decrease (value ?p3) 1) (increase (cost) 1) (increase (value ?p4) 1))
  + fire-three-to-one: ?p1 - place ?p2 - place ?p3 - place ?p4 - place
      pre: (and (> (value ?p1) 0) (> (value ?p2) 0) (> (value ?p3) 0) (three-to-one ?p1 ?p2 ?p3 ?p4))
      eff: (and (decrease (value ?p1) 1) (decrease (value ?p2) 1) (decrease (value ?p3) 1) (increase (total-cost) 1) (increase (value ?p4) 1))
Init:
  - (= (cost) 0)
  + (= (total-cost) 0)
Metric:
  - (cost)
  + (total-cost)
Func prop:
  - (cost): in_init init_all_nonneg init_all_nonpos init_all_int in_metric is_metric_alone in_eff write_delta_nonneg write_delta_nonneg_int
  + (total-cost): in_init init_all_nonneg init_all_nonpos init_all_int in_metric is_metric_alone in_eff write_delta_nonneg write_delta_nonneg_int
